430:**O-REPLAY pin scope (RULINGS Q45a, Q45b).** Accepted at 8cc2c26 (29 files, V-O03 (lab/verify/O02/VERIFY.md; verify/O02 8f631ab; merged 4591715)). Uses: 119; may close: 106; blocked: 13. an oracle that exits 2 with X-NOT-MODELED for a case has not modeled it: every obligation selecting that case fails closed (stays OPEN); the refusal is never treated as a case-authoring error and never skipped. Erasure cases spell the op erase; outbox steps are never encoded as O-REPLAY ops, because O-DOMAIN owns them (RULINGS Q45b).
