923:- **R independent of P.** A cut is (scope, P, optional R, V). Recorded visibility is `recordedPosition <= P` and, when R is bound, `recordedAt <= R`, evaluated independently: an assertion with a later position but an earlier instant is invisible at P below its position, and an assertion at a lower position with an instant above R is invisible at R.
932:Each case file entry carries: resultSemantics: set | bag | ordered; groupingKey: list of variables with COMPARISON_RULES identity; unboundHandling: exclude-row | null-cell (stated per projected variable); comparator: CMP-SET-ROWS | CMP-BAG-ROWS | CMP-ORDERED-ROWS; expectedRows; citation (SPARQL 1.1 or SQL section, or the packet task).
938:- An unbound projected variable is a null cell only where the case says null-cell; otherwise the row is excluded.

